(LEGAL-001 - OPERATIVE CLAUSES & STATUTORY DIRECTIVES \(PAGE 2\)) Tj T*
(Title: Tamil Nadu Protection of Tanks and Eviction of Encroachment Act, 2007 \(Act ) Tj T*
(Addressed / Competent Officer: Assistant Engineer / Junior Engineer \(WRD Irrigation Section\) & Tahsildar) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 1: Section 4 & Section 6) Tj T*
(Section 4 mandates the Survey Officer to survey irrigation tanks, fix boundary) Tj T*
(stones along the Full Tank Level \(FTL\) and foreshore, and publish the tank chart.) Tj T*
(Section 6 empowers the Officer of the Public Works / Water Resources Department to) Tj T*
(issue Form-II and Form-III notices directing any encroacher to remove the) Tj T*
(encroachment within 21 days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 2: Section 7 & Section 8) Tj T*
(Section 7 empowers the WRD Officer, with police and revenue assistance, to) Tj T*
(summarily evict any person failing to comply with a Section 6 notice and forfeit) Tj T*
(crops or structures erected inside the tank bed, bund, supply channel, or surplus) Tj T*
(course. Section 8 prescribes imprisonment up to 3 months or fine for unlawful) Tj T*
(entry, bund damage, or obstruction of water flow.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
